  "prefLabel": "He-W 538.03 Provider Participation",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-06-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 538.03 Provider Participation. All NHCM providers shall:\n\n(a) Be enrolled New Hampshire medicaid providers; and\n\n(b) Be certified to practice midwifery in New Hampshire pursuant to RSA 326-D:6.\n\nSource. #7657, eff 3-5-02, EXPIRED: 3-5-10\n\nNew. #9737, eff 6-25-10, EXPIRED: 6-25-18\n\nNew. #12783, eff 5-21-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
